           ("What makes pavers sink on a Nokomis lot?", "Water carrying fines out of the base: a downspout, a leaking irrigation line, or new-construction fill that was never compacted in lifts. East of I-75 the newer communities were built on imported fill, and settlement shows up in the first three years."),
