           ("How old are Venice Gardens homes and what does that mean for driveways?", "Mostly 1950s to 1970s block homes with original driveways poured thin on sand. Replacement on a compacted base is the standard job; overlays on these slabs fail."),
           ("Are the lots on septic?", "Many South Venice lots are on septic and well. A drain field sets where a slab or pavers can go, and well water stains driveways with iron."),
           ("Is South Venice in a flood zone?", "AE along Lemon Bay, Alligator Creek and the Intracoastal; most interior lots are X."),
